        <div class="step-card emerald">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❸</div>
            <div class="step-title">Sign In Button (#btn-login)</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">onSubmit Event</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Triggered on click or Enter key:
            <br>• Disables button and displays a rotating CSS spinner (<code>.auth-spinner</code>).
            <br>• Transmits JSON payload to <code>/api/auth/login</code>.
            <br>• Validates password against bcrypt hash in MongoDB Atlas.
            <br>• Sets signed 30-day JWT cookie <code>social_pulse_token</code>.
          </div>
