            <div class="step-action-tag">setState(formOpen: true)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Renders the modal overlay (<code>DataModal</code>) enabling full CRUD operations: date selection, platform metric inputs, auto-calculations, and week deletion.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card rose">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❺</div>
            <div class="step-title">Logout Button (#btn-logout)</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">POST /api/auth/logout</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Deletes the <code>social_pulse_token</code> cookie server-side, resets AuthContext state, and redirects the browser back to <code>/login</code>.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-footer">
      <div class="footer-brand"><span>SOCIAL PULSE</span> · Action Bar Architecture</div>
      <div>Header Micro-Interactions</div>
    </div>
