  <!-- ================= PAGE 4: PULSEBAR & WEEK SELECTION ================= -->
  <div class="page">
    <div class="page-header">
      <div class="page-title-wrap">
        <div class="badge-category">Time Series & Historical Navigation</div>
        <div class="page-title">4. PulseBar &amp; Weekly Time-Travel Flow</div>
        <div class="page-subtitle">Instant historical navigation: dynamic bar height scaling and synchronous state recalculation without page reload.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="page-meta">
        <div class="page-num">PAGE 04</div>
        <div>PULSE_WEEK_FLOW</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-grid grid-2col">
      <div class="screenshot-frame">
        <div class="frame-header">
          <div class="window-dots"><span class="dot-red"></span><span class="dot-yellow"></span><span class="dot-green"></span></div>
          <div>PulseBar Component View (.pulse-bar)</div>
          <div style="color: #10b981;">Active Week: Latest</div>
        </div>
        <div class="screenshot-img-wrap" style="padding: 24px;">
          <img src="screenshots/04_pulse_week_bar.png" alt="PulseBar" style="box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); border-radius: 8px; width: 90%;" />
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 12px; font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.5; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2); border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;">
          <strong style="color: #fff;">Mathematical Bar Height Algorithm:</strong>
          <br><code style="color: #38bdf8; font-family: Consolas, monospace;">h = minH (8px) + (i / max(weeks.length - 1, 1)) * (maxH (30px) - minH - 4)</code>
          <br>The active week bar expands to <strong>30px</strong> and reflects the active platform's theme color accent.
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-steps-col">
        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❶</div>
            <div class="step-title">PulseBar Dot Button (.pulse-dot)</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">onClick: onSelectWeek(i)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Each vertical bar represents a distinct 7-day reporting cycle (e.g. <code>2025-01-06 to 2025-01-12</code>). Hovering displays full date range tooltips.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card emerald">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❷</div>
            <div class="step-title">Synchronous State Mutation (activeIndex)</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">setState(activeIndex: i)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Clicking a bar re-points <code>activeWeek = weeks[activeIndex]</code> throughout the React component tree with sub-16ms render latency.</div>
          <div class="step-outcome">✓ 0ms latency client recalculation</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card purple">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❸</div>
            <div class="step-title">Header Week Range Badge Sync</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">formatWeekLabel(weekId)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">The top title badge <code>.title .week-range</code> updates its formatted text automatically (e.g., <em>"Jan 06 – Jan 12, 2025"</em>).</div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card amber">
          <div class="step-header">
            <div class="step-badge">❹</div>
            <div class="step-title">KPI Cards &amp; Chart Redraw</div>
            <div class="step-action-tag">calcSummary(activeWeek, prevWeek)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="step-desc">Compares active week data against preceding week <code>weeks[activeIndex - 1]</code> to recompute percentage growth badges (+14.2% ↑ or -3.1% ↓) in real time.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page-footer">
      <div class="footer-brand"><span>SOCIAL PULSE</span> · Pulse Engine</div>
      <div>Time-Travel Analytics State</div>
    </div>
  </div>

